  "title": "Material Master Data Overview",
  "description": "Master data is the core data essential for running operations within a business enterprise. When an embedded EWM (Extended Warehouse Management) system is installed, the ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) system shares most of the master data directly with EWM. As a result, a product containing only global data is automatically created when the material is created. The diagram highlights the flow of master data from ERP to EWM:\n\n- **ERP Master Data:** Includes Plant, Shipping Point, Customer, Vendor, and Material Master.\n- **EWM Master Data:** Includes Location and Business Partner, and manages Product data.\n\nThe system ensures seamless integration and data sharing between ERP and EWM systems to improve operational efficiency."
