          "It is not allowed for down payment invoice corrections (YVM7), ARM credit notes (YVH2), and similar scenarios."
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Additional Logic for Error Prevention",
        "details": [
          "Logic is implemented to avoid creation of credit/debit note requests if the price is zero or negative.",
          "An error message will occur in such cases."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnote": "DC/PJ-GWF | 24.01.2025 | © Bosch Rexroth AG 2025."
  }
}
