  "title": "Comprehensive Guide to Managing Customer Return Orders",
  "description": {
    "overview": "This document provides a detailed guide to the 'Manage Customer Return Order' process (O2C_02.060) under the 'Order to Cash' framework. It outlines standard and special case handling for customer returns, supported by Advanced Returns Management (ARM), and includes tools, transaction codes, and parameters for efficient processing.",
