        "title": "General Description",
        "content": "The process handles customer returns for DC materials due to reasons like wrong orders, late deliveries, and recalls, excluding service/repair/guarantee processes and shipping damage claims. ARM is the foundation, covering return order creation, delivery, inspection, follow-up, refund, and billing."
